# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Legacy static mirror of the old site.
#
# These live at the project root and are byte-for-byte duplicates of what is
# already in public/, plus the scraped HTML of the previous site. Next.js only
# ever serves from public/, so none of this reaches the deployed app — it just
# doubled the size of the repository. Kept on disk, excluded from the deploy.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/_next/
/*.html
/*.html.before-*
/seq/
/map-seq/
/about/
/awards/
/team/
/maps/
/dda/
/embasy/
/embasy-2/
/infinity/
/infinity-east/
